# Muller-Plathe reverse-NEMD kappa point for Si1-xGex, SiCGe.tersoff.
# Shard-action version (2026-09-29): identical to in.mp_kappa2 plus one print of the final potential energy per atom (structural metadata for detector v2). Derived from in.mp_kappa (Phase B follow-ups, 2026-09-26): same
# protocol, but the cross-section (ncxy, was fixed at 4) and the swap
# interval (swapn, was fixed at 50) are now command-line variables so the
# campaign can probe cross-section convergence and steep-gradient bias.
# Defaults reproduce in.mp_kappa exactly. Variables:
#   -var x <x_ge> -var T <K> -var ncz <cells> -var seed <int>
#   -var ncxy <cells> -var swapn <steps between swaps>
#   -var pot <path to SiCGe.tersoff> -var out <output prefix>
# Protocol: NPT equil 50 ps, MP warmup 100 ps (discarded), production
# 500 ps, 20 z-bins. Analysis in analyze_mp.py.

variable x     index 0.5
variable T     index 300
variable ncz   index 24
variable seed  index 20260925
variable ncxy  index 4
variable swapn index 50
variable pot   index SiCGe.tersoff
variable out   index mp_out

units metal
boundary p p p
variable a0 equal 5.431+(5.658-5.431)*v_x
lattice diamond ${a0}
lattice diamond 5.6353
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5.6353 5.6353 5.6353
region box block 0 ${ncxy} 0 ${ncxy} 0 ${ncz}
region box block 0 4 0 ${ncxy} 0 ${ncz}
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 ${ncz}
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 48
create_box 2 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (22.5412 22.5412 270.4944)
  1 by 1 by 16 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 6144 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (22.5412 22.5412 270.4944)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds
if "${x} > 0" then "set type 1 type/fraction 2 ${x} ${seed}"
set type 1 type/fraction 2 ${x} ${seed}
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.9 ${seed}
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.9 2101
Setting atom values ...
  5503 settings made for type/fraction
mass 1 28.0855
mass 2 72.63
pair_style tersoff
pair_coeff * * ${pot} Si(D) Ge
pair_coeff * * /uufs/chpc.utah.edu/sys/installdir/r8/lammps/08022023.3/share/lammps/potentials/SiCGe.tersoff Si(D) Ge
Reading tersoff potential file /uufs/chpc.utah.edu/sys/installdir/r8/lammps/08022023.3/share/lammps/potentials/SiCGe.tersoff with DATE: 2009-03-18

timestep 0.001
thermo 10000
velocity all create $(2*v_T) ${seed} dist gaussian
velocity all create 1732 ${seed} dist gaussian
velocity all create 1732 2101 dist gaussian
fix npt all npt temp ${T} ${T} 0.1 aniso 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix npt all npt temp 866.0 ${T} 0.1 aniso 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix npt all npt temp 866.0 866.0 0.1 aniso 0.0 0.0 1.0
run 50000
